science.epfl.ch/record/149056"}, {"title": "IMU Bulletin no. 42, Special Issue, July 1998", "url": "https://www.mathunion.org/fileadmin/IMU/Publications/Bulletins/1994_1999/42/report.html"}, {"title": "library.iut.ac.ir", "url": "https://library.iut.ac.ir/Inventory/100/23615.htm"}]}, "The 1994 International Congress of Mathematicians was held in Zürich, Switzerland. Several sources agree on this. The IMU's proceedings list the event as August 3-11, 1994 in Zurich (Zurich, Switzerland). The Congress president's report describes it as held in Zurich on those dates (Zurich, Switzerland, on August 3-11). The lectures took place at the city's Kongresshaus and at the Federal Institute of Technology (ETHZ) and the University of Zurich (the Kongresshaus of the city of Zurich). The IMU's 1994 General Assembly was held separately in Lucerne, Switzerland, just before the Congress (Lucerne, Switzerland, July 31 - August 1, 1994)."], "durationSeconds": 4.633758917, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01XV72j94EyfHwcKNfzeajUy", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
